  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Festa 2013 was held at Intex Osaka on 15 December and at Tokyo Big Sight on 23 December 2013, and every visitor got an original Helioptile card. In its Victory Battle, four straight wins in the Challenge Stage earned a Muscle Band and a place in the Premier Stage, four-player knockouts whose winners went on to the Climax Stage, and the top three of the elementary school league and the open league each day won Victory Ring in gold, silver or bronze. Play Points from the side events, tag, mission and one-day battles, bought a Gogoat for three points or a holo Tierno stamped with the event's logo for ten.",
